1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,070
Man: Good morning. What seems to be the problem?

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:09,650
Woman: I've had a bad headache for three days, and I feel tired all the time.

3
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,680
Man: Are you sleeping well?

4
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:16,710
Woman: Not really. I've been working late every night this week.

5
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:22,400
Man: I think you need more rest. Try to go to bed before eleven.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,780
Woman: Should I take any medicine?

7
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:29,800
Man: You can take this for the headache, twice a day after meals.

8
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,200
Woman: Thank you, doctor.

